        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "77957480-8f7b-5774-9ae6-bf91e063e568",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix, Benjamín Arellano Félix, Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo\n- Organizations: Tijuana Cartel, Arellano-Félix Organization\n- Roles: drug lord, drug trafficker, former leader\n- Topics: drug trafficking in Mexico\n\nFacts:\n- Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix was born on 24 October 1949 and died on 18 October 2013.\n- Benjamín Arellano Félix was born on 12 March 1952.\n- Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo was one of Mexico’s most prominent drug czars during the 1980s.\n- Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix was a Mexican drug lord and a former leader of the Tijuana Cartel, a drug trafficking organization.\n- Benjamín Arellano Félix is a Mexican drug trafficker and former leader of the Tijuana Cartel, also known as the Arellano-Félix Organization.\n- Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix joined the Tijuana Cartel in 1989 through his brother Benjamín after Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo was arrested.\n- Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix was the oldest of seven brothers and led the Tijuana Cartel with them in the early 1990s.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
